window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>We are told God will punish the wicked; that sinful men will reap what they sow. We are told to scourge our souls with prayer and pain to become clean once again. </p> <p>Well, here I am. Wicked and sinful. Desperate to become clean - even though it feels so good to be dirty. </p> <p>But even I never expected what came next. Even I never expected my punishment to come so soon. </p> <p><i>Midnight Mass</i> is a novella and a sequel to <i>Priest</i>. It’s intended for mature audiences only.</p>"; 
